              <p>You are <strong>solely and entirely responsible</strong> for any content you submit through this application. The developer of SharkToothify bears <strong>no responsibility, liability, or accountability</strong> — civil or criminal — for the nature, legality, accuracy, or consequences of any image or content you upload, share, or process using this app. By using SharkToothify, you agree to indemnify and hold harmless the developer from any claim, loss, or liability arising from your submitted content.</p>

