              <p>Your profiles, finds, badges, photos, and settings are stored <strong>only on this device</strong> (browser localStorage and IndexedDB) — SharkToothify operates no accounts and keeps no server copy of your collection. The only data that ever leaves your device: (1) a tooth photo and your notes, sent solely to produce an AI identification (to Anthropic via your own key, or to the SharkToothify identification service); (2) approximate coordinates or ZIP code, sent to NOAA, the National Weather Service, and an open geocoder to fetch tides and weather; (3) checkout, handled entirely by Stripe under its own terms — card details never touch SharkToothify. No ads, no tracking SDKs, no sale of data. Clearing browser storage or using <strong>Clear App Data</strong> permanently removes all local data — use <strong>Settings → Backup &amp; Restore</strong> first.</p>

