              <p>Tide and weather information is sourced from NOAA and the U.S. National Weather Service and is provided "as is," with no guarantee of accuracy or availability. It is <strong>not intended for navigation, boating, or safety-of-life decisions</strong> — always verify conditions with official sources before entering the water.</p>

