              <p>AI identification packs are consumable credits linked to this device via a private token; keep your Stripe purchase confirmation to restore them. Except where required by law, sales are final once credits are delivered. "Buy Dev a Coffee" contributions are voluntary gifts. Fossil-collecting rules vary by location; you are solely responsible for complying with local laws and permits.</p>

