              <p>These Terms are governed by the laws of the State of North Carolina, USA, without regard to conflict-of-law rules, with exclusive venue in the state and federal courts of Mecklenburg County, North Carolina. Contact: <strong>updates@sharktoothify.us</strong>.</p>

